{"ts": "2026-11-17T13:46:26+00:00", "run": "20261117T191248", "ticket": "T015", "outcome": "dry_run", "action": "reply", "language": "nl", "category": "question", "priority": "P4", "confidence": 0.97, "faq_ids": ["F04", "F05"], "model_action": "reply", "hard_rules": [], "escalated_because": [], "reply_en": "Hi,\n\nYes, Roosterly can export the approved hours to Loket.nl. This payroll integration is part of our Plus subscription. You can set it up via Settings → Integrations → Payroll. Since you currently have a Basic subscription, you first need to upgrade to Plus. You do that via Settings → Subscription; the new price applies from the next invoice.\n\nRegards,\nTeam Roosterly", "redacted": [], "seconds": 7.16}
