{"ts": "2026-11-17T13:49:30+00:00", "run": "20261117T191248", "ticket": "T029", "outcome": "dry_run", "action": "reply", "language": "de", "category": "question", "priority": "P4", "confidence": 0.99, "faq_ids": ["F03"], "model_action": "reply", "hard_rules": [], "escalated_because": [], "reply_en": "Hello,\n\nEmployees can swap shifts in the mobile app by opening the shift and tapping \"Ruil aanbieden\" (Offer swap). Colleagues with the same role can accept the offer. The manager must then approve the swap under Rooster → Verzoeken (Rota → Requests). Approval is enabled by default; you can disable it under Instellingen → Rooster (Settings → Rota) if desired.\n\nKind regards\nTeam Roosterly", "redacted": [], "seconds": 3.26}
